  -	Include the number of overdue Purchase Orders.
  -	Include the overdue Purchase Order summary.
  -	Include outstanding quantities.
  -	Include follow-up status.
  -	Mention any Purchase Order requiring manual review.
  -	Provide relevant Business Central document links if available.
  If no overdue Purchase Orders are identified
  Respond:
    No overdue Purchase Orders requiring follow-up were identified based on the current Business Central data.
    Do not create or send unnecessary vendor communication.
  If processing cannot be completed
  -	Request User Intervention.
  -	Explain why processing could not be completed.
  -	Mention missing or invalid information.
  -	Request clarification or additional details.
  -	Do not report the Purchase Order as successfully processed.

